            "text": "Reentrancy in Vault.withdraw() (contracts/Vault.sol#11-16):\n\tExternal calls:\n\t- (ok,None) = msg.sender.call{value: amount}() (contracts/Vault.sol#13)\n\tState variables written after the call(s):\n\t- balances[msg.sender] = 0 (contracts/Vault.sol#15)\n\tVault.balances (contracts/Vault.sol#5) can be used in cross function reentrancies:\n\t- Vault.balances (contracts/Vault.sol#5)\n\t- Vault.deposit() (contracts/Vault.sol#7-9)\n\t- Vault.withdraw() (contracts/Vault.sol#11-16)"
